## LiteSpeed Cache - Used by C# DevKit
## VS Code developers think that they should be committed, but they're just polluting the repository with 
## generated files that can be easily recreated. These files are generated by the C# DevKit _preview_ extension 
## for Visual Studio Code, and they contain cached data that helps improve performance. However, they are not 
## necessary for the functioning of the project and can be safely ignored.
**/*/*.lscache
